// Lyrics must align to their notes even when the bar OPENS with a mid-piece
// time-signature change. Bar 1 is a 3/4 pickup ("la la la"); bar 2 switches to
// 4/4 and carries "Twin- kle twin- kle". The syllables must spread across bar 2's
// four notes - the leading time grob used to skew the slot X and cluster them.
title "Lyrics under a mid-piece meter change"
time 3/4
key c major

part melody { clef treble }

section A { g4 a b | time 4/4 c' b a g | a b c'2 | }
lyrics words sings melody { la la la | Twin- kle twin- kle | lit- tle star | }

form main { A }

score main "midmeter" { staff melody  lyrics words }
